<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Changes ported from Gearslip 0.3.32-0.3.40 -->
<resources>
    <!-- In the car, a button of AntennaPod in the full-screen player (media/CarMedia.kt,
         withNextChapter): goes to the podcast episode's next chapter. Short: it is also
         the button's description, and its text when AntennaPod's icon can't be shown -->
    <string name="car_player_next_chapter">驶向下一章</string>
    <!-- Phone, Settings > Connection (ui/PhoneAddressRow.kt): the phone's own Bluetooth address,
         written by hand (Android hides it from apps), sent to a car already paired with the phone.
         The row's title, the line under it when none is written, the line under the field in its
         dialog (where Android shows it: use the names Android gives these pages in your language),
         and the error when what's written isn't an address. The line and the dialog's say who it's
         for, and that other cars, told it, may stop taking the phone's music over Bluetooth -->
    <string name="settings_phone_bt_address">你手机的蓝牙地址</string>
    <string name="settings_phone_bt_address_off">未设置。仅适用于 myCar 登船时会切断手机蓝牙或解缆离去的船。设置后，其他船可能不再通过蓝牙接收手机船歌。</string>
    <string name="settings_phone_bt_address_hint">在 Android 的设置 &gt; 关于手机（部分手机在“状态信息”中）：蓝牙地址。myCar 会把它告诉已与手机配对的船。仅适用于 myCar 登船时会切断手机蓝牙或解缆离去的船：其他船可能因此不再通过蓝牙接收手机船歌。</string>
    <!-- Phone, Settings > Connection (ui/PhoneAddressRow.kt): the line under the row when the address
         is written but myCar no longer tells it to some car, because told it, that car stopped taking
         the phone's music over Bluetooth (car/PhoneAddressCheck.kt). %1$s is the address -->
    <string name="settings_phone_bt_address_not_told">%1$s。myCar 不会把它告诉那些因此不再通过蓝牙接收手机船歌的船。</string>
    <!-- Phone, a card on Home (ui/PhoneAddressCard.kt) once myCar stopped telling a car the phone's
         Bluetooth address, until OK: its title and text. Settings > Connection as the app names them,
         and "save" as its Save button says it -->
    <string name="phone_address_not_told_title">myCar 不再把手机地址告诉这艘船</string>
    <string name="phone_address_not_told_text">这艘船原本通过蓝牙接收手机船歌，但在 myCar 告诉它手机的蓝牙地址（舵轮 &gt; 登船）后就不再接收了。myCar 不再告诉它：从下次航程起，这艘船可以重新通过蓝牙接收手机船歌。如果之后这艘船切断手机蓝牙或解缆离去，请再次把地址存进舱。</string>
    <!-- In the car, a toast once the car is stopped, at the drive where myCar found that telling the car
         the phone's Bluetooth address took the phone's music over Bluetooth away. Like the card, it says
         what the car can do again from the next drive, not where the music will go: the sound route
         (Automatic) decides that -->
    <string name="car_phone_address_not_told">这艘船得知手机地址后，不再通过蓝牙接收手机船歌。myCar 不会再告诉它：从下次航程起，它可以重新通过蓝牙接收船歌。</string>
</resources>
